  data: {
    LLM: 'Always prioritize uncovering hidden cards in the tableau over drawing from the stock.\n\nEmpty slots: Do not create an empty column unless you have a King ready to fill it, as empty columns are the only way to move large card blocks.\n\nFoundation Balance: Build the foundation piles evenly. If you move one Red suit to the foundations but leave the other Red suit in the tableau, you may block your ability to move Black cards in the tableau.',
    Player: 'Always prioritize uncovering hidden cards in the tableau over drawing from the stock.\n\nEmpty slots: Do not create an empty column unless you have a King ready to fill it, as empty columns are the only way to move large card blocks.\n\nFoundation Balance: Build the foundation piles evenly. If you move one Red suit to the foundations but leave the other Red suit in the tableau, you may block your ability to move Black cards in the tableau.',
